{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "4889e3afdc5367cbf19072840277c5de2cc001dc6372ffd1a1fb2625cc6c8adc", "ja": "観光Chu→FUTURE♪", "zh": "观光Chu→FUTURE♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fd9fe3ab4b115c9f420d60913351019e9ef6db3679c9a6a63668a69919b2d5a6", "ja": "地方公演は大成功。メンバー達は帰る前に、\nしばらく観光を楽しむ。こんな風に新しい経\n験を積んで、もっともっとレベルアップして\nいきたいと語る杏奈と百合子を、プロデュー\nサーは温かく見守るのだった。", "zh": "地方公演圆满成功。\n成员们在踏上归途前，享受了一下观光行程。\n杏奈与百合子表示，未来还想像这样继续\n累积新的经验，不断提升等级，制作人则\n用温暖的目光守望着她们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "17fd97541309c6aec7f93549a0e879932655162a4f52a2414c70e1ce8589bb66", "ja": "こうして、私と杏奈ちゃんの大冒険は、\nひとまずエンドマークを迎えたのでした……。", "zh": "就这样，\n我跟小杏的大冒险暂且划下休止符……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "14978edacb30bad54932dbebc7c3488c73a2953accfdc406fcccbeb98bd3d343", "ja": "でも、風の戦士の旅に、終わりはありません。\n次の冒険のため、遥かなる地平線を目指して……。", "zh": "不过，风之战士的旅途是没有终点的。\n为了下一场冒险，继续迈向遥远的地平线……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "55888bfced6d3665ac4958a9733ea042741aa5d82a810f31ed5171c9c6dd7f37", "ja": "……百合子、さん？", "zh": "……百合子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "5095bab3d0d528234bf96121a15ca69c38bcb58fa3c6f7d3b20f486b9ae3fd1a", "ja": "ひっ！　あ、杏奈ちゃん……。ごめんね、\nちょっと地平線が気になって……。", "zh": "呃！小、小杏……\n抱歉，我只是对地平线有点好奇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "28fd66f74cbb8102413ff2cc93474b388c0105ab353e5690c6dcc18142c3773f", "ja": "あのね。{$P$}さんが、\n電車の時間まで、観光していい、って……。", "zh": "那个啊，{$P$}先生说，\n在搭电车之前，我们可以去观光……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "d13b0ac2c8afe3829e7851b57b016a7f9bcbe2002e96dca5f9069cf2c5665966", "ja": "えっ。いいんですか、\n{$P$}さん！？", "zh": "咦，{$P$}先生，\n真的可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9a9f28f22ff22fcd90fcff889e775e239a57a8d86c090bf7ab3ec0d4206d9313", "ja": "ああ、少しくらいなら大丈夫なんだ。それに、\nせっかく遠くまで来たのに、もったいないからな。", "zh": "嗯，去逛一下没有关系。\n况且，难得跑到这么远的地方来，不逛逛就太可惜了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "b822d1b5ed2b5be979e5d1d5d0bff950e039dd97d9edb6a786c50e71286f5ce0", "ja": "やった～！　ありがとうございますっ♪", "zh": "太好啦～！谢谢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "b044a6232851b4802b62c26b5577b64378d29522a47b2e57b69d88d868a8c7e3", "ja": "みんなも、行きたいところ、あるみたい……。\n百合子さんも、一緒に……いこ？", "zh": "大家好像，也有想去的地方……\n百合子也……一起去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "3866121fbcc280ea87ac30bb965b8ba8a526305760df7a6d0224bd00b51e4755", "ja": "もちろんだよ、杏奈ちゃん！\nえへへ、みんなで修学旅行に来たみたい♪", "zh": "当然啊，小杏！\n嘿嘿，感觉好像跟大家来毕业旅行一样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "89f34baaeafa9c1d75824f63e0c3d2961c05d14c0953113400d5c3fd10875bde", "ja": "うん……♪", "zh": "嗯……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "01534ba1d484d2d0e6522f40d8207bc222f6dc211244bc507a40ad390758c407", "ja": "ふぉぉ、杏奈ちゃん、こっち向いてくださーいっ！\n観光地ならではのスマイル、いただきですっ！！！", "zh": "唔喔喔，杏奈，请看这边──！亚利沙就收下这个\n只有在观光景点才看得到的笑容了！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "14c87adfa78842bf6863019290edeb3408168bbed67745cb7364eba3e96d9fbd", "ja": "……。\n今、プライベート……だから。", "zh": "……\n现在是……私人时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "6941cd7c12f899fea976fd827a0f94d2e7d53322f6b2bc31489556f2ef5634ac", "ja": "それより亜利沙さん、早く行こうよ～。\n時間、そんなにないんだから。はやくはやく！", "zh": "先别拍了，亚利沙姊姊，我们快走吧～\n没有多少时间了。快点快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "a2470a5bc1123dcbde546115d9bcb8e34758d70a4cf41dcd51d8882a564dd480", "ja": "あああっ、待ってください、育ちゃん！\nありさを置いてかないでくださーい！", "zh": "啊啊啊，等等啊，小育！\n请别丢下亚利沙──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "7e7a6e356749ce8a1cb55eed7d323bb7a23cb410427c39209327dec006dbd29c", "ja": "可憐さんは、どこか行きたいところって、\nあるんですか？", "zh": "可怜，\n你有想去的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "a99f6c9242ccc2f4cf98149663d439a73cca993f5c926c498a27ad6313f6a7dd", "ja": "私、着いた時から、気になる雑貨屋さんがあって……\nあ、でも、無理に行かなくても……。", "zh": "我刚到这里的时候，就很想去一家杂货店……\n啊，不过也不用勉强去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "2a963f34d9a0f923b0c4a783f07c019f13567c478893d0116381fedd417ad070", "ja": "いいじゃないですか。行きましょう。\n私もお土産、何か買いたいですし。", "zh": "不错啊，我们去吧。\n反正我也想买点伴手礼之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "110f67fda6bb2b78c665d9eaacdf7e3c6c1de3206991d10982fd803dad8fbc42", "ja": "あ、そうなんだ？\nよかった……じ、じゃあ、一緒に……♪", "zh": "啊，是这样吗？\n太好了……那、那就，一起去……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "21841a26d9b9f959109f1e2168d4e86160b578bc27b53811fc98429c7f381cbe", "ja": "百合子さん、このお店……。\n限定アイテム、だって……。", "zh": "百合子，这间店……\n说是有，限定商品……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "01e731288576e11b6f004805651b5b227eab723809fe94a5fcef35136e4ec48b", "ja": "本当だ！　ご当地限定の……黄緑色の、お団子？\nおいしいのかな？", "zh": "真的耶！当地限定的……黄绿色团子？\n会好吃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "886412e2e3af5bd8a28d8f60660d3c8c1a971b81d1e3accfc91d36386e76b701", "ja": "ぱくっ。\n……ん、おいしい。", "zh": "（大口）\n……嗯，很好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "0385893560d8b5929473c56076244d983cddda9f584cd7a5f894eec66dfba7b6", "ja": "はっ。ためらわないで試食するなんて……\nさすが勇者だね！　よーし、私も……ぱくっ。", "zh": "啊，竟然毫不犹豫就试吃了……\n真不愧是勇者！好，我也要……（大口）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "a3663e1b3b4db23cab07b6f40d3b337c3a1be1080d3c1b3594546f432a944971", "ja": "……んんっ！　ほんとだ、おいしい！\nまた新しい初めてを体験しちゃったよ、杏奈ちゃん♪", "zh": "……嗯嗯！真的很好吃耶！\n我们又体验一件新事物了，小杏♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1024_024ann", "source_sha256": "da962434ff695d912bbd3cb2653c0a20b70fb33ef39d75cc5a52aa9d41ee4df9", "ja": "ん……♪　百合子さん。杏奈、これからも……\nいろんなこと、一緒に……したい。", "zh": "嗯……♪百合子，杏奈，今后也想跟你……\n一起做……各式各样的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1025_024ann", "source_sha256": "c1a6fa5c2e693d4d3ac92b4e7422e0a5649209bf47f93a1f71e1f0d5a1246eda", "ja": "ライブしたり、おいしいもの、食べたり……。\nどんどん、レベルアップ、したい……。", "zh": "像是举办演唱会，还有吃好吃的东西……\n一直继续，提升等级……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "9200b3c0b4b4814f2b8c2ebb58a84595553bf4b920070f9b2bd2a4c38562b53c", "ja": "そうだね！　vivid_rabbitが\nこれから、どんな冒険に挑んでいくとしても……。", "zh": "说得好！\n今后无论vivid_rabbit要挑战什么样的冒险……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "55cb0dec43b18fc7c39f6a16bb34657c52ff828e9bd7d9d7e2e740d88a677794", "ja": "隣にはいつもlilyknightがいるからねっ！", "zh": "身旁一定都会有lilyknight在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1028_024ann", "source_sha256": "a97de0cfdb2a1496cb587aa539a151d0517d15dc97e35ebf4ed9eeafbe61e58b", "ja": "うん……。\nありがと……です♪", "zh": "嗯……\n谢谢……你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "f780bbfaa69445bb7d08bf9c65359f35e62d22c8cbeb8a476a96c54bb6e0b800", "ja": "（杏奈と百合子にとって、この冒険……じゃなくて\n地方公演は、かけがえのない経験になった）", "zh": "（对杏奈跟百合子来说，这场冒险……不对，\n这场地方公演，是一次无可取代的经验。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0072_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "dde04310c0edda3ee4502ac5707927edc1284f346e1a9d86c0276bea727fb40e", "ja": "（劇場に戻ったら、まずは少しだけ成長した\n二人の姿をお披露目しないとな！）", "zh": "（等回到剧场后，\n首先得让大家看看她们稍微成长后的模样呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
